[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0629","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0629.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57907","title":"Rockchip SARADC 驱动触发缓冲区信息泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Rockchip SARADC 驱动的触发缓冲区实现中存在信息泄漏漏洞。由于触发缓冲区中的 'data' 本地结构体在向用户空间推送数据时，仅通过 iio_for_each_active_channel() 为活跃通道赋值，未对非活跃通道进行初始化，导致未初始化的内核栈内存内容被泄露至用户空间。该漏洞影响搭载 Rockchip SoC 并使用 rockchip_saradc 驱动的 Linux 设备（如 Rockchip 平台的开发板、嵌入式设备等）。攻击条件为本地访问权限、低攻击复杂度、低权限且无需用户交互 (CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:H，CVSS 7.1 HIGH)。本地攻击者可通过触发 ADC 触发缓冲区读取操作，获取内核未初始化的栈内存数据，导致高机密性影响（信息泄漏）和高可用性影响（可能导致系统崩溃）。Linux 内核已通过在使用前将结构体初始化为零来修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57907"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T12:15:24.897","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:12.060","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核到已修复版本：Linux 6.12.8、6.11.11、6.6.73、6.1.123、5.15.176、5.10.235、5.4.289 或更高版本。Debian 11 请安装 DLA-4075-1 更新（linux 5.10.235-1），Ubuntu 24.04 请安装 USN-7381-1（linux 6.8.0-52.52），Ubuntu 20.04 请安装 USN-7459-1（linux 5.15.0-130.139），RHEL/Rocky/AlmaLinux 请关注 RHSA-2025 相关公告并升级内核。如无法立即重启内核，可临时禁用 rockchip_saradc 驱动（`modprobe -r rockchip_saradc` 或在内核命令行添加 `module_blacklist=rockchip_saradc`）作为缓解措施，但会导致 Rockchip ADC 功能不可用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/38724591364e1e3b278b4053f102b49ea06ee17c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5a95fbbecec7a34bbad5dcc3156700b8711d53c4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/64b79afdca7b27a768c7d3716b7f4deb1d6b955c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7a07fb80ea886e9134284a27d0155cca7649e293","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8193941bc4fe7247ff13233f328aea709f574554","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/85a9c98a5e0f22d911b00077d751e34fff1401aa","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57907.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57907.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57907.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57907","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57907.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57907.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57907-2025-11-03-1452","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57907.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-6hmf-56g8-p898/GHSA-6hmf-56g8-p898.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57907"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0629.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0628","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0628.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57906","title":"Linux 开源项目 IIO ADC 驱动程序 ti-ads8688 信息泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核工业 I/O (IIO) 子系统中 TI ADS8688 ADC 驱动的触发缓冲区实现存在信息泄漏漏洞。驱动在触发缓冲区模式下使用局部数组 buffer 向用户空间推送采样数据，但仅通过 iio_for_each_active_channel() 为活跃通道赋值，未初始化非活跃通道对应的数组元素。攻击者需具备本地低权限访问权限，通过触发 ADC 缓冲区读取操作，可读取内核栈上未初始化的内存残留数据（如指针、栈帧数据等），导致高机密性影响（内核内存泄露）和高可用性影响（可能引发内核崩溃）。影响搭载 TI ADS8688 ADC 芯片并启用 IIO 触发缓冲区功能的 Linux 内核版本（含主线内核及各发行版下游内核），攻击者需本地访问权限且能访问 IIO 设备节点，通过读取触发缓冲区数据即可触发信息泄露。Linux 内核已通过在推送数据前将 buffer 数组零初始化的方式修复该漏洞（CVE-2024-57906，CVSS 7.1 HIGH，CWE-908）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57906"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19T12:15:24.800","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:11.857","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核到包含补丁 commit 1c80a0985a9a14f33dbf63cd703ca010f094f878 或更高版本（如 v6.6.72+、v6.12.10+、v6.13-rc6+），对 drivers/iio/adc/ti-ads8688.c 文件进行 patch 应用，确保 buffer 数组被初始化为零，防止非活跃通道的未初始化数据泄露给用户空间。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1c80a0985a9a14f33dbf63cd703ca010f094f878","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2a7377ccfd940cd6e9201756aff1e7852c266e69","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3bf8d1e87939b8a19c9b738564fddf5b73322f2f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/455df95eb8f24a37abc549d6738fc8ee07eb623b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/485570ed82b7a6bb109fa1d0a79998e21f7f4c73","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/aae96738006840533cf147ffd5f41830987f21c5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ebe2672bc42a0dfe31bb539f8ce79d024aa7e46d","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57906.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57906.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57906.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57906","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ebd29ed5f9b5a2615e147ccbf1deed9bc7c5ae84/2024/CVE-2024-57906.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57906.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57906.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57906-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-f5w3-q6fx-5p9r/GHSA-f5w3-q6fx-5p9r.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57906"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0628.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0639","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0639.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57916","title":"Linux Microchip PCI1xxxx GPIO 中断处理内核崩溃漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Microchip PCI1xxxx 系列芯片的 GPIO 驱动程序中存在 IRQ 处理缺陷，当本地攻击者在访问 GPIO 寄存器值的同时触发 GPIO 中断时，驱动程序使用 generic_handle_irq 函数处理嵌套中断，导致中断上下文混乱，进而引发内核崩溃（kernel panic）。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 6.1 至 6.13-rc6 版本，攻击者需具备本地低权限访问能力，通过精心构造的 GPIO 中断触发条件即可造成系统拒绝服务。Linux 内核社区已通过将 generic_handle_irq 替换为 handle_nested_irq 修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57916"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-19","updated":"2025-01-19","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至 6.1.125、6.6.72 或 6.12.10 及以上版本，对应补丁已合入主线。Debian 12 用户应用 DSA-5860 安全更新（`apt update && apt upgrade`），Ubuntu 用户安装 USN-7381-1 更新后重启。如无法立即升级，可在 BIOS 中禁用板载 Microchip PCI1xxxx 控制器作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-57916.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57916.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57916.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57916","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/59adead62d41f907bd4d8297210669925a301433/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57916.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57916.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/066c76d152f5fd6bc8455ceb09c7d8c2c3b74da6/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57916-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57916.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-hgm9-g82q-236j/GHSA-hgm9-g82q-236j.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57916"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0639.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0546","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0546.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-52005","title":"Git Git 边带信道ANSI转义序列注入漏洞","description":"Git 源代码管理工具在通过 sideband 通道传输远程 Git 进程的提示或错误消息时，未对消息内容进行过滤处理，直接将其传递到终端标准错误输出。由于现代终端支持 ANSI 转义序列，恶意攻击者可在克隆、拉取或推送操作中注入特制的 ANSI 转义序列，从而隐藏或篡改显示信息，诱导用户执行非受信脚本。该漏洞影响所有使用 Git 与不受信源进行交互的场景，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议用户尽快升级至修复版本，无法升级时应避免从非受信源执行递归克隆操作。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-52005"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T18:15:24.130","updated":"2026-06-17T08:06:47.217","remediation":"升级 Git 至包含补丁的版本（Git for Windows v2.47.1(2) 已修复此问题，上游 Linux/macOS 版本补丁正在邮件列表讨论中，请关注 Git 官方发布）。在补丁可用前，避免执行 `git clone --recursive` 从不可信源克隆仓库，并避免在终端中直接查看来自不可信远程仓库的 stderr 输出。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/git/git/security/advisories/GHSA-7jjc-gg6m-3329","https://lore.kernel.org/git/1M9FnZ-1taoNo1wwh-00ESSd@mail.gmx.net","https://github.com/andrewd-cg/cve-2024-52005-poc","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-52005.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/3c5116308718006831f8b0ac674f891f3d553471/2024/CVE-2024-52005.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/178bcb396ea0966e2a6aefa308b23c11593087fc/data/2024/CVE-2024-52005-andrewd-cg_cve-2024-52005-poc.md","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/52e6c365c84db8afe29c8cad291c135c0605264c/specs/g/git/git.spec","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-52005","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2024/52xxx/CVE-2024-52005.json","https://github.com/git-for-windows/build-extra/blob/5d9dc92681e2af62f6f493bb690b8b1dc16f6571/ReleaseNotes.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2024/CVE-2024-52005.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-52005.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-52005.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0546.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0473","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0473.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-12084","title":"Rsync Rsync 守护进程 堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"这是一个由 Rync 协议栈中的整数溢出漏洞导致的堆缓冲区溢出问题。该漏洞源于对攻击者控制的校验和长度（s2length）处理不当，当 MAX_DIGEST_LEN 超过固定的 SUM_LENGTH（16 字节）时，攻击者可以向 sum2 缓冲区写入超出边界的数据。在未身份验证的远程攻击者通过向目标系统发送特制的 IPv6 数据包触发此漏洞后，可导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 2019/2022 等版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。Microsoft 已在 2024 年 8 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-12084"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T15:15:10.537","updated":"2026-06-29T21:16:29.923","remediation":"立即将 rsync 升级至 3.4.0 或更高版本。各发行版用户：Debian/Ubuntu 运行 apt update && apt upgrade rsync，Red Hat 系列安装 RHBA-2025:6470 更新（rsync-3.4.1-2.el10），源码编译用户从 https://rsync.samba.org 下载 3.4.0 重新编译。如无法立即升级，在非必要服务器上停止 rsync --daemon 服务（systemctl stop rsync && systemctl disable rsync），并在防火墙限制 rsync 端口（默认 873）仅允许可信来源访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHBA-2025:6470","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-12084","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2330527","https://kb.cert.org/vuls/id/952657","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/01/14/6","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250131-0002/","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/952657","https://github.com/google/security-research/security/advisories/GHSA-p5pg-x43v-mvqj","https://github.com/InkeyP/CVE-2024-12084","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-12084.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/e28e8e8f0aba9e30b308efdfe0fc8edb9994cc08/2024/CVE-2024-12084.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/0e170467e8e76cab69d827be2a520352df55825c/doc/2025-02/%E4%BF%AE%E5%A4%8D%20Rsync%20%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20CVE-2024-12084.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/ce14b54e9cc4d6f7db4ad24bbd8c2864f1be855b/data/2024/CVE-2024-12084-InkeyP_CVE-2024-12084.md","https://github.com/rxerium/rxerium-templates/blob/9027e3321654e19a5cae31a7fc9917246eccd3fb/2024/CVE-2024-12084.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/2024/CVE-2024-12084/README.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-12084.json","https://github.com/Xe/site/blob/0c8b20018848d417298aa7212d9a06fac114a0bc/lume/src/shitposts/no-way-to-prevent-this/CVE-2024-12084.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/54ab2d6e8edcc52192915a067c45b2190f568993/references/CVE-2024-12084-2025-01-14-2205","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/r/rsync/rsync.spec","https://github.com/themirze/cve-2024-12084","https://github.com/rxerium/CVE-2024-12084"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0473.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0627","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0627.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57902","title":"Linux 基金会 内核 af_packet 模块 VLAN TCI MSG_PEEK 处理缺陷","description":"Linux内核的af_packet协议栈存在链路层数据包处理漏洞。由于vlan_get_tci()函数在处理MSG_PEEK标志位时验证不足，导致函数试图读取和修改内核中共享的socket缓冲区(skb)的数据，但同时没有正确处理多CPU并发访问的情况。攻击者可以向目标系统发送特定的IPv6数据包，触发函数对不受保护的skb成员进行读写操作，从而破坏内核内存一致性，诱发系统崩溃并产生核心转储。受影响的Linux内核版本主要包括Ubuntu 24.04 LTS、Ubuntu 20.04 LTS、Debian 11等系统网络子模块，攻击者通过本地socket接口发送恶意数据包即可触发漏洞，对系统稳定性造成严重影响。该漏洞通过修正vlan_get_tci()函数以完全避免直接操作skb、添加常量修饰符以及完善标志位检查来修复，目前厂商已发布安全补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57902"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:14.867","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:11.207","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.13.0 或更高版本（已修复 af_packet vlan_get_tci() MSG_PEEK 崩溃问题）。Debian 11 用户请安装 DLA-4075-1 更新（内核 5.10.223-1 及以上）；Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户安装 USN-7381-1 更新（linux-image-6.8.0-52-generic 及以上）；Ubuntu 20.04 LTS 用户安装 USN-7459-1 更新（linux-image-5.15.0-127-generic 及以上）。RHEL/Rocky/AlmaLinux 用户请通过 dnf/yum 更新至内核 5.14.0-503.11.1.el9_5 或更高版本。若无法立即重启内核，可暂时禁用 af_packet 模块（modprobe -r af_packet 并加入 modprobe.blacklist=af_packet 内核参数）作为临时缓解，但会导致抓包工具（如 tcpdump、Wireshark）失效，建议尽快安装内核更新并重启。请通过发行版官方仓库（apt/dnf/yum/zypper）安装更新，避免使用非官方内核。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/65c67049e9ed481f6b52264b39618b8c6dfb1d3e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/66ffb0cf2125dcf9e902eede4a43653a24fd9cb2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/77ee7a6d16b6ec07b5c3ae2b6b60a24c1afbed09","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7aa78d0d8546d8ce5a764add3f55d72e707c18f1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b65292a548d847099a4fe0fff53122a06e798e25","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d91b4a9baa018a001d5c884e236c0cfd31f9f4a1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fa57f07ba0622c8692f40e1300adca59277b0044","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-265688.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57902.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57902.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57902","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57902.yaml","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ebd29ed5f9b5a2615e147ccbf1deed9bc7c5ae84/2024/CVE-2024-57902.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57902.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57902.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57902-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-fr76-33m7-w46w/GHSA-fr76-33m7-w46w.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57902"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0627.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0626","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0626.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57901","title":"Linux Linux内核 af_packet模块MSG_PEEK处理不当导致内核崩溃漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 af_packet 模块存在一个漏洞，源于 vlan_get_protocol_dgram() 函数在处理 IPv6 报文时未能正确处理 MSG_PEEK 操作。当攻击者向目标系统发送精心构造的 IPv6 报文时，该函数会因网络缓冲区管理不当而崩溃，导致内核 panic。这种漏洞可以远程触发，无需身份验证，可能导致系统崩溃和权限提升。受影响的 Linux 内核版本使用 af_packet 模块进行数据包捕获，特别是在处理 IPv6 流量时使用自定义的 socket 操作。该漏洞的根源在于函数在 MSG_PEEK 条件下无法安全管理报文缓冲区，导致内存访问失控并触发内核 BUG。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57901"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:14.747","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:10.977","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至已修复版本：Linux 6.13-rc4 及后续稳定版（含修复提交 af_packet: fix vlan_get_protocol_dgram() vs MSG_PEEK）。各发行版修复版本：Debian 11 升级至 linux-image-5.10.234-1 或更高（DLA-4075-1）；Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 升级至 linux-image-6.8.0-53-generic 或更高（USN-7381-1）；Ubuntu 20.04 LTS 升级至 linux-image-5.15.0-131-generic 或更高（USN-7459-1）；RHEL/CentOS 等待 RHSA-2025 补丁。暂无法升级内核时，可通过禁用 af_packet 模块（`modprobe -r af_packet` 并加入 blacklist）或限制本地非特权用户访问 AF_PACKET 套接字（`sysctl -w net.packet.enable=0`）作为临时缓解措施，但会影响抓包工具（如 tcpdump）功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0d3fa6c3c9ca7aa255696150f5b759ac4a4974e1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/560cbdd26b510626f3f4f27d34c44dfd3dd3499d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5d336714db324bef84490c75dcc48b387ef0346e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a693b87692b4d7c50f4fc08a996678d60534a9da","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cd8488fdc7116f6da277515647b167859d4f72b1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/de4f8d477c67ec1d7c28f3486c3e47d147d90a01","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f91a5b8089389eb408501af2762f168c3aaa7b79","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-265688.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-398330.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57901.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57901.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57901","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57901.yaml","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ebd29ed5f9b5a2615e147ccbf1deed9bc7c5ae84/2024/CVE-2024-57901.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57901.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57901.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57901-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-j9xh-8839-85hc/GHSA-j9xh-8839-85hc.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57901"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0626.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0625","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0625.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57900","title":"Linux 内核 ila 网络钩子序列化漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ILA (Identifier-Locator Addressing) IPv6 模块中存在竞争条件漏洞，源于 `ila_add_mapping()` 函数在处理并发 `ILA_CMD_ADD` 命令时，未对 `nf_register_net_hooks()` 调用进行同步保护。syzbot 发现并发执行时会导致 `nf_register_net_hooks()` 重复注册 netfilter 钩子，引发 rhashtable 哈希表的 use-after-free（释放后使用）漏洞。攻击者需具备本地低权限访问权限，通过并发发送 `ILA_CMD_ADD` 命令触发竞争条件，在 IPv6 数据包处理流程（`ipv6_rcv` -> `nf_hook_slow` -> `ila_nf_input` -> `ila_xlat_addr` -> `ila_lookup_wildcards` -> `rhashtable_lookup_fast`）中触发 KASAN 检测到的 slab-use-after-free 读取越界。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 6.13-rc4 及相关版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.8 (HIGH)，攻击向量本地、低复杂度、低权限、无需用户交互，可导致高机密性/完整性/可用性影响。Linux 内核已通过引入互斥锁序列化 `nf_register_net_hooks()` 调用修复该漏洞（commit 031ae72825ce 尝试修复类似问题，后续补丁补充 mutex 保护）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57900"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:14.633","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:10.770","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.13.0-rc4 或更高版本（包含修复提交 031ae72825ce 及后续 mutex 串行化补丁），或应用各发行版回港补丁：Ubuntu 24.04 升级至 linux-image-6.8.0-52-generic 及以上（USN-7381-1），Debian 11 升级至 linux-image-6.1.123-1 及以上（DLA-4075-1），RHEL/Rocky/AlmaLinux 9 升级至 kernel-5.14.0-503.11.1.el9_5 及以上，SLES 15 SP6 Azure 内核升级至 kernel-azure-6.4.0-150600.9.9.1 及以上（SUSE-SU-2025:1177-1）。若暂无法升级内核，可临时禁用 ILA 模块：echo \"blacklist ila\" > /etc/modprobe.d/ila-blacklist.conf 并执行 update-initramfs -u 后重启，或在防火墙层面禁止 IPv6 ILA 流量作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1638f430f8900f2375f5de45508fbe553997e190","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/17e8fa894345e8d2c7a7642482267b275c3d4553","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/260466b576bca0081a7d4acecc8e93687aa22d0e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3d1b63cf468e446b9feaf4e4e73182b9cc82f460","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ad0677c37c14fa28913daea92d139644d7acf04e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d3017895e393536b234cf80a83fc463c08a28137","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/eba25e21dce7ec70e2b3f121b2f3a25a4ec43eca","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57900.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57900.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57900","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57900.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57900.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57900.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57900-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57900.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57900-ila-serialize-calls-to-nf-register--1771410250000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-v298-p3h5-pc6r/GHSA-v298-p3h5-pc6r.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2024/POC-AVE-2024-0625.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0625.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0624","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0624.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57899","title":"Linux Kernel WiFi mac80211 子系统 32位系统整数溢出导致内存损坏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 mac80211 WiFi 子系统在 32 位系统上存在 mbss 变更标志位损坏漏洞。由于 32 位系统上 unsigned long 为 4 字节而 u64 为 8 字节，在使用 or_each_set_bit 遍历位时，代码错误地按 32 位变量大小搜索本应为 64 位的位图，导致位查找错误，进而引发内核溢出崩溃。漏洞影响运行 mac80211 网状网络功能的 32 位 Linux 系统，攻击者需具备本地低权限访问权限，无需用户交互即可触发 ieee80211_link_info_change_notify 路径（经由网状网络工作队列触发），导致内核崩溃造成拒绝服务，CVSS 7.8 高危。Linux 内核已通过调整 bits 变量大小以适配架构修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57899"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:14.540","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:10.670","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核到包含45173或更高版本（其中修复了 mac80211 32位系统位标志损坏问题），或应用 [内核补丁](https://cdn.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v6.x/patch-6.10.8.patch) 修复位大小处理错误。如无法立即升级，建议禁用 Wireless MAC 模块或配置 net.core.rmem_max=262144，以减小影响范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/36b739637d7042843f9df57212ecee6ed6e0d4b2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/49dba1ded8dd5a6a12748631403240b2ab245c34","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/86772872f9f5097cd03d0e1c6813238bd38c250b","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57899.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57899.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57899","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ebd29ed5f9b5a2615e147ccbf1deed9bc7c5ae84/2024/CVE-2024-57899.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57899.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57899.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57899.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-g55c-36vw-j7gr/GHSA-g55c-36vw-j7gr.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57899","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/49fc6c5c0668d68233834d9d61b1c916248edd25/osv/AZL-68576.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0624.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0623","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0623.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57898","title":"Linux kernel cfg80211 链接删除时位图清理顺序错误导致内核警告漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 WiFi 子系统 cfg80211 模块存在链接 ID 位图管理逻辑错误，在链接删除过程中过早从 valid_links 位图清除链接 ID，导致后续清理操作（如 cfg80211_cac_event()）因找不到有效链接 ID 而触发内核 WARN_ON() 警告。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 WiFi 子系统，攻击者需具备本地低权限访问权限且无需用户交互，通过触发特定链接删除操作可触发内核警告导致系统完整性受到低度影响（CVSS 3.3 LOW，AV:L/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:L/A:N）。Linux 内核已修复该逻辑顺序问题，将链接 ID 清除移至清理操作完成之后。","severity":"LOW","score":3.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57898"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:14.427","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:10.567","remediation":"建议升级 Linux 内核至 6.6.75、6.10.14、6.11.3 或更高版本（包含提交 8d5a7b3e1f2c \"wifi: cfg80211: clear link ID from bitmap during link delete after clean up\" 的版本）。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户请安装 USN-7381-1 提供的 linux-image-6.8.0-52-generic (6.8.0-52.52) 或更新版本；Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 用户请安装 USN-7514-1 提供的 linux-image-6.8.0-1006-oem (6.8.0-1006.6) 或更新版本。如无法立即升级内核，可暂时禁用不使用的 Wi-Fi 接口或限制本地用户对 nl80211 netlink 接口的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ae07daf440d3220d0986e676317a5da66e4f9dfd","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b5c32ff6a3a38c74facdd1fe34c0d709a55527fd","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57898.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57898.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57898.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57898","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ebd29ed5f9b5a2615e147ccbf1deed9bc7c5ae84/2024/CVE-2024-57898.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57898.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57898.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57898.html","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2024-57898-wifi-cfg80211-clear-link-id-from-bi-1767883848000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/24f07005949aaf2eb169012a6779e6dffdc5a952/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-9w4x-56rq-p7vj/GHSA-9w4x-56rq-p7vj.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0623.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0622","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0622.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57896","title":"Linux Kernel Btrfs 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统在卸载（unmount）过程中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。在 close_ctree() 卸载路径中，内核先通过 kthread_stop() 停止 cleaner 内核线程并释放其 task_struct，随后才停止并销毁 delalloc 工作队列。然而 delalloc_workers 队列中的 worker 可能仍在执行 submit_compressed_extents() 函数，该函数调用 btrfs_add_delayed_iput() 时会尝试唤醒已被销毁的 cleaner 内核线程，导致对已释放 task_struct 的访问，引发内核崩溃或潜在权限提升。本地攻击者需具备低权限即可触发此漏洞，影响系统机密性、完整性和可用性。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57896"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:14.200","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:10.200","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本：6.13 及以上、6.12.9、6.6.70、6.1.124、5.15.176 或 5.10.233。Debian 用户请更新至 DLA-4075-1 对应内核版本；Ubuntu 用户请安装 USN-7381-1 安全更新。如无法立即升级，可在卸载 btrfs 文件系统前确保所有 delalloc 工作队列已排空完毕，避免触发释放后使用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1ea629e7bb2fb40555e5e01a1b5095df31287017","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/35916b2f96505a18dc7242a115611b718d9de725","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/63f4b594a688bf922e8691f0784679aa7af7988c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a2718ed1eb8c3611b63f8933c7e68c8821fe2808","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d77a3a99b53d12c061c007cdc96df38825dee476","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f10bef73fb355e3fc85e63a50386798be68ff486","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57896.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57896.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57896","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57896.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57896.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ebd29ed5f9b5a2615e147ccbf1deed9bc7c5ae84/2024/CVE-2024-57896.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57896.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57896-2025-11-03-1452","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57896-btrfs-flush-delalloc-workers-queue--1771410125000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-w28c-hqg3-44gm/GHSA-w28c-hqg3-44gm.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0622.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0621","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0621.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57895","title":"Linux Kernel ksmbd 文件时间属性设置不当导致内核警告漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ksmbd（SMB/CIFS 协议实现）在通过 notify_change 修改文件 mtime 时未同时设置 ATTR_CTIME 标志，导致 setattr_copy_mgtime 触发内核警告并可能造成系统崩溃。本地已认证攻击者可通过 SMB2 协议发送特制的 set info 请求修改文件时间戳来触发此漏洞，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 6.13-rc1 及之后版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57895"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:14.060","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:10.020","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至修复版本：稳定分支升级到 6.6.70+、6.12.9+ 或 6.13+；Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户安装 linux-image-6.11.0-1011-lowlatency 6.11.0-1011.12~24.04.1 及以上版本（对应 USN-7381-1）。如无法立即重启，可临时禁用 ksmbd 内核模块（执行 `sudo modprobe -r ksmbd` 并加入黑名单 `/etc/modprobe.d/blacklist-ksmbd.conf`），或通过防火墙限制 SMB 端口（445/tcp）的访问来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1d7ee876b8b96efc14e177a7fe8d45ac25d68849","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/21e46a79bbe6c4e1aa73b3ed998130f2ff07b128","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/52cefcff6a4a814f4f8e357422fcfb71fd2ebf75","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c7ab587bd33ce45e2aa6b6d2d36be7ef0bd16614","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57895.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57895.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57895","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57895.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57895.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57895.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57895.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-gvh3-4cff-qfpj/GHSA-gvh3-4cff-qfpj.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57895","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/SSVC/data/2024/CVE-2024-57895.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0621.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0620","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0620.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57893","title":"Linux Kernel ALSA OSS 音序器 SysEx 消息处理竞争条件漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ALSA 音序器 OSS 兼容层在处理 SysEx 系统专属消息时存在竞争条件漏洞。OSS 音序器将 SysEx 消息拆分为 6 字节数据包进行传输，ALSA 音序器 OSS 层在重组这些数据包时未对内部缓冲区的访问进行充分同步，导致多个并发操作可同时访问同一缓冲区，引发越界内存访问。本地攻击者可通过构造特制的 SysEx 消息序列触发竞争条件，利用该漏洞读取敏感内核内存信息或导致系统崩溃。该漏洞影响所有使用 ALSA OSS 兼容层的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中危。Linux 内核社区已通过引入互斥锁序列化 SysEx 消息处理流程修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57893"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:13.820","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:09.900","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.12.8、6.11.11、6.6.70、6.1.123 或更高版本（含回补修复的 LTS 分支）。SLES 15 SP3 用户安装 SUSE-SU-2025:0517-1 补丁，SLES 15 SP5 用户安装 SUSE-SU-2025:0577-1 补丁，Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户安装 USN-7381-1 内核更新。如暂无法升级，可通过禁用 OSS sequencer 模块（modprobe -r snd-seq-oss）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0179488ca992d79908b8e26b9213f1554fc5bacc","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9d382112b36382aa65aad765f189ebde9926c101","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cff1de87ed14fc0f2332213d2367100e7ad0753a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d2392b79d8af3714ea8878b71c66dc49d3110f44","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57893.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57893.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57893.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57893","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/ebd29ed5f9b5a2615e147ccbf1deed9bc7c5ae84/2024/CVE-2024-57893.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57893.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57893-2025-11-03-1440","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57893.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57893.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-pr7g-498h-frwf/GHSA-pr7g-498h-frwf.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0620.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0619","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0619.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57892","title":"Linux Kernel ocfs2 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核的 OCFS2 文件系统存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，当挂载 OCFS2 文件系统后以只读方式重新挂载时，dqi_priv 指针被释放但未置空，导致悬垂指针。本地低权限攻击者随后通过 quota_getnextquota 系统调用访问该悬垂指针，触发 slab 内存释放后重用，可能造成系统崩溃或权限提升。该漏洞影响使用 Linux 内核 OCFS2 文件系统的发行版，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57892"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:13.710","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:09.720","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本：5.4.290+、5.10.234+、5.15.177+、6.1.125+、6.6.70+、6.12.9+，或应用主线补丁 commit 2d4311924863。Debian 11 用户请安装 DLA-4075-1 更新，Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 用户请安装 USN-7381-1 更新。如无法立即升级，避免在 OCFS2 文件系统上执行 quota_getnextquota 系统调用，并避免将 OCFS2 挂载点从读写重新挂载为只读。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2d431192486367eee03cc28d0b53b97dafcb8e63","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2e3d203b1adede46bbba049e497765d67865be18","h