_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0619.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0618","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0618.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57890","title":"Linux 内核 RDMA/uverbs 整数溢出漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 RDMA/uverbs 子系统中存在整数溢出漏洞，`cmd.wqe_size * cmd.wr_count` 等乘法运算中两个操作数均为用户可控的 u32 值，相乘结果可导致整数回绕，进而传递给 `uverbs_request_next_ptr()` 时引发越界访问。本地低权限攻击者可通过构造特制的 RDMA 用户空间请求触发该漏洞，导致系统崩溃（拒绝服务）。该漏洞影响所有使用 Linux 内核的发行版，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57890"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T13:15:13.473","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:09.430","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至以下安全版本：5.4.289、5.10.233、5.15.176、6.1.124、6.6.70、6.12.9 或更高版本。对于 Debian 系统，执行 `apt update && apt upgrade linux-image` 安装 DLA-4075 安全更新；对于 Ubuntu 系统，执行 `apt update && apt upgrade linux-image-generic` 安装 USN-7381-1 更新。如无法立即重启，可临时限制对 RDMA 设备的本地访问权限，通过 `chmod 600 /dev/infiniband/uverbs*` 限制非 root 用户操作，或通过内核模块黑名单 `echo \"blacklist ib_uverbs\" > /etc/modprobe.d/disable-rdma.conf` 禁用 RDMA uverbs 模块作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/346db03e9926ab7117ed9bf19665699c037c773c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/42a6eb4ed7a9a41ba0b83eb0c7e0225b5fca5608","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b3ef4ae713360501182695dd47d6b4f6e1a43eb8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b92667f755749cf10d9ef1088865c555ae83ffb7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c2f961c46ea0e5274c5c320d007c2dd949cf627a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c57721b24bd897338a81a0ca5fff41600f0f1ad1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d0257e089d1bbd35c69b6c97ff73e3690ab149a9","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00002.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57890.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57890